Recorded output
  The recordings under results/ hold what AWS services and the software in use printed or
  returned, as it came: listings, events, log lines and error messages.
  results/evidence/cloudwatch/*.png were drawn by Amazon CloudWatch
  (GetMetricWidgetImage) from this study's metrics, and
  results/evidence/region-availability.json was read through the AWS MCP server.

AWS prices
  results/pricing/*.json holds prices read from the AWS Price List API, the Savings Plans
  API and the Amazon RDS reserved DB instance offerings API, and one price read through
  the AWS Pricing MCP server. results/evidence/price-cross-check.json holds four more
  that were read through that server. The prices are AWS's; results/bom.json,
  report/tables and section 6 of docs/01-research-notes.md repeat them or compute with
  them.

